WEBVTT

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.000
I can't believe my eyes!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.750
Just what on earth is happening here in Obara?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.460
Oka!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.630
I am the nether realm. The nether realm is me.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.290
All objects and spirits, all living beings
that thrives in this realm...

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:29.580
I shall consume everything whole and make it mine!

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.500
We gotta get away from the red light!

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.170
It's happening again...

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:45.380
The same tragedy from 8 years ago
is about to be repeated.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.710
We've lost the war.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.080
Kakeru?!

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.170
Lady Oka?!

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.330
All our sacrifices didn't make a difference...

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.580
it's like we're destined to lose to the Oni!

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.710
Don't be ridiculous.

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.130
We're still alive!

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:05.210
It's not over.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:07.710
We can still fight!

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.710
There's absolutely nothing we can do without Oka...

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:17.830
It's over...

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.500
The Myojin Shrine Maiden is gone.

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:25.540
There are no souls left who
would dare to oppose me now!

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.580
Yes there are! Right here!

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.920
We'll keep slaying Oni, for as long as we can!

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:37.000
We will never give up!

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:39.210
This battle isn't over yet!

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:41.380
Pathetic fools.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.630
Deny the futility of your situation all you want,
it won't save you!

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:47.420
Lady Oka is alive!

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:49.290
And so is Kakeru! We know it!

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.960
They'll come back to us. For sure!

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.210
Indeed!

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:56.420
I have personally acknowledged
the toughness of Kakeru Miwa!

00:01:56.790 --> 00:02:00.790
I'm willing to stake it all on them. On Kakeru and Ibara!

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:07.130
I would be a terrible sister if I didn't believe in Oka.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:09.960
So I can't let things end like this!

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:11.630
Shuten!

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:14.080
We're going to put a stop to you!

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:16.420
Let's do this!

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:17.750
Right!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:24.000
<b>Future</b>

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.920
...keru... wake up!

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:28.960
Kakeru! Wake up!

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:39.580
Oh crap! It's super late!

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:41.790
I gotta get home!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.330
<b>MIWA</b>

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:56.670
Huh?

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.500
Kakeru sure is late.

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.880
Do you think something happened?

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:08.790
I bet he'll be back soon.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:12.790
Dad... Mom...

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:14.540
Kakeru!

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.710
Don't do it!

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.630
There's a battle you need to go fini-!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:25.420
I'm sorry.

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:33.210
I'm home!

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:34.960
Welcome back.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.380
I'm hungry!

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.460
I don't wanna be the Shrine Maiden!

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:49.080
I'm so afraid of dying!

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:53.420
It's going to be okay.
You can just let me handle it for you.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.080
Huh?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.960
I will perform the ritual on your behalf.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:02.960
So you don't have to worry your pretty little head.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.290
Really?

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:06.670
Yes.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.630
Go on and get some sleep.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.630
When you wake up tomorrow, everything will be over.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.250
Give Oka back right now!

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.000
Come back to us, Kakeru!

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:32.210
Y'know, I've always wanted
the chance to fly together with you.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.420
Because it's thanks to you
that I have these wings, Haruko.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:38.960
Kaede...

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.170
Let's take them back.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.790
Kakeru! And Oka!

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:44.500
Right!

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:47.290
Kakeru! Keep a hold of yourself!

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.630
And never let go of Lady Oka!

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:54.460
I think I heard... someone calling me...

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:56.500
It's just your imagination.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.210
But...

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.880
I made your favorite curry for dinner!

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.170
A special day calls for a special meal.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.170
Special day?

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:08.170
To celebrate you coming back to us, Kakeru.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.130
Did that hurt him?

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:26.540
He regenerated!

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:34.250
Lady Benio!

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:39.000
Those of the nether shall exist within the darkness.
Those of the ephemeral shall exist upon the land.

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:40.960
Now let the edge of this blade send you...

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.130
Back to hell!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:45.630
Oka!

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:53.750
Big sis?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.710
Guys?

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.960
It'll take far more than this to imprison me!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.750
But our voices got through!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.250
Oka!

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.290
Lady Oka!

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.040
Please return to us!

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:15.000
Kakeru!

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:16.210
Kakeru!

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:17.710
Kakeru!

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:19.750
Silence, worms.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.880
You were just an Oni trying to trick me!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.250
You're afraid of dying, aren't you?

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.380
You don't want to be the Shrine Maiden, right?

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.960
That doesn't matter. I still...

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.000
have to go!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:47.580
Kakeru!

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:50.960
Don't go!

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:55.630
If you stay here with us, you can be
the same Kakeru that you've always been!

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:58.460
As the precious son we've always loved!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.920
Dad, Mom...

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.790
I've missed you so much.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.960
I'm glad I got to see you.
Even if you're nothing more than an illusion.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:18.750
Thank you.

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:21.330
But... I have to go.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:23.790
Go back...

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:25.580
Go back...

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.420
...to the place I belong.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.750
<b>8 Years</b>

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.750
<b>Ago</b>

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.750
Cut me down! Now!

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:37.420
But sir!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.880
If you don't slay me, Shuten will
be released upon the world!

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:43.580
Forgive me!

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.960
If only Shuten had never shown up...

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.040
Lady Hazuki could have succeeded!

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:05.000
I'm back. Sorry to keep you, Ibara.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.040
Took you long enough, dipshit.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.500
This is what happened 8 years ago...

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:12.670
Let's kick some ass, Ibara.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.790
We're going to save Oka!

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:15.630
Right!

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.830
I thought about it and I don't want you to die.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.130
Please stay alive!

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:27.830
There's someone who cherishes me
more than I cherished myself.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.750
Kakeru!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:33.880
And after I met Oka, I finally understood why I survived!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.330
Oka!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.170
I have to find Kakeru!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:40.830
There are so many things I have to ask and say to him!
Where do I even start?

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:42.420
Kakeru!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.130
Mother?!

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.330
Go now.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:16.710
Shikizakura.

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.210
Shikizakura.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:29.580
Why bother standing? Why bring yourself more pain?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.580
I simply don't understand.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.880
Because I swore to myself...

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:36.750
to continue being a sister who Oka can be proud of!

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:38.920
I'll get up as many times as it takes...

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.170
to make sure you never threaten anyone again!

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.500
What is this...?!

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:57.000
Make way for the almighty Ibara!

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:58.080
Kakeru!

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.040
Shuten!

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:02.250
This will never end how you want it to!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:04.670
Sorry we took so long.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:05.960
Oka!

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:07.830
Impossible!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.710
How did you come back?!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.420
We heard the voices calling our names.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.290
Everyone reached out to us!

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:18.040
Way to go, nerds! All your hard work paid off!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.580
Miss Benio, please trust me!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.750
I will not let Oka die! No matter what!

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.040
Oka's in your hands now.

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:27.210
Right!

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:28.380
Shuten!

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:30.750
I've lost everything twice now.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.670
My home! My father! My mother!

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.000
But I'm still here!

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.880
Not to save the past, but to save the future!

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.080
We're taking it all back.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:41.250
Our own futures.

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:42.960
And the future of humanity!

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:45.580
I see.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.920
I now finally understand what it means to commit a "sin".

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:53.330
Sinners are people like you!

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:56.420
Powerless maggots who dare to obstruct
the actions of supreme deities such as myself!

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:59.130
You will not be allowed to live or die!

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:05.960
Instead I'm going to feed off your despair
as you suffer agonizing pain for all eternity!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.040
Accursed Shrine Maiden!

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:17.000
Now! Let's do this!

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.830
Are you getting this on camera?

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:24.000
There's a group of powered suits bravely
fighting back against the giant monster!

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:25.750
Kaede! Hang in there!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:29.580
Everyone stay calm! Please don't push as you evacuate!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.170
Guys, look!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.170
Whoa!

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.460
Keep fighting!
You can do it!<b>
Stay tough!</b>

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.170
Go!

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:44.330
Why resist me?

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:48.710
You had a taste of it within my body!
Of true peace without suffering!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:53.750
Becoming one with me guarantees you
the most perfect form of salvation there will ever be!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:57.250
You may have swallowed us whole,
but that doesn't mean you understand us!

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.250
Salvation is not something we need!

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:00.960
Is that so?

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:02.500
Fine then!

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:04.080
Die!

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:16.830
You made a mistake by stealing
my mother's body like that.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:21.080
Because on behalf of my parents and our whole family...

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:24.290
I'll make you pay for it!

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.960
I was such an idiot to fall for the Oni's tricks.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.500
Those bastards trespassed in my very heart!

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:41.790
How dare you steal my dreams!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:44.250
Never do it again!

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:52.750
You talk about "salvation", but all
you really want is to control everyone!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:54.750
The only way to be saved...

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.460
is by saving ourselves!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:01.380
Shut up! You damn insects!

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:07.420
I've waited so many damn years for this opportunity.

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:10.130
No, if you include all my ancestors...

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:14.080
We've waited for centuries!

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:18.250
I've always had the same dream!

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:20.290
To create a world free of Oni!

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:21.830
And now is the time!

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.750
To make that dream come true!

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:29.880
My duty has always been to eliminate the Oni.

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:31.830
But my dream was for Oka's survival.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.210
Thank you, Kakeru Miwa.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.250
For the first time in my life...

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.130
My duty and my dream!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.080
Are the same!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:43.540
This cannot be!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.210
The reason that I survived!

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.460
The reason I entrusted it to her!

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:52.880
The reason I became a hero!

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.960
The reason I teamed up with Kakeru!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.000
We're going to protect Oka!

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:59.250
Using this life we obtained!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:00.420
Say Goodbye!

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:02.790
Because this fight is over!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.790
It's time for me to end this.

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.460
Leave here and return from whence you came.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:38.500
Not yet...

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:41.710
This will not be the end...

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.170
You're not getting away!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:50.250
Gotcha.

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.290
Kaede! Haruko!

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:55.790
The only ones who can go past
this point are Oni and the Shrine Maiden!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:56.670
In that case...!

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:57.460
Okay!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.170
Go!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.000
Thank you!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:05.880
Kakeru!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.630
Let's have faith in him.

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:14.040
Please, Kakeru. You have to come back.

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:17.040
Because I need to ask you something!

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:24.420
I must admit, I'm impressed!
You two chased me all the way to the void!

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:27.420
Listen, Shuten.

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:30.000
There's no place for you to belong anymore!

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.210
Not in the mortal realm or the nether realm!

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:33.830
Hold on!

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:36.920
You know I have the power to control Oni.

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:39.210
Just think about that.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.630
It means I also have the power
to grant people's wishes freely!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.710
Any wish at all?

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:46.790
That's right.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:50.330
Speak your desire! And I shall grant it!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.500
Sounds like a good deal.

00:15:57.960 --> 00:15:59.250
I wish...

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.080
For you to disappear!

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:10.750
The path to salvation has now been cut off...

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:14.790
Enjoy a life of crawling around the mortal world
like the sorry worms you are.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:19.790
We humans can walk just fine, thank you.

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:29.630
We don't need to use your power.

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:35.170
All right!

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:36.540
Hooray!

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.330
Kakeru... you survived that, right?

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:47.130
That's that, I guess.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.380
Shuten is gone, but someone will replace him eventually.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.130
You think so?

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:58.790
Yep. That's why we gotta split
the mortal and nether realms apart.

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:00.250
Forever.

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.790
If we close this gate up,

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:09.040
then the entire Myojin family, Oka included,
will never have to sacrifice themselves again.

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.000
Yeah.

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:15.670
No time to waste. Let's put an end to all this, buddy.

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:23.580
The gate is starting to close.

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:27.130
What about Kakeru...?

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:29.290
Kakeru's the one closing it.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.460
So you don't have to.

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:35.710
Please no...

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.580
Kakeru! Leave the rest to me.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.170
You hurry back to the other side.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:52.460
Hold on, partner.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:54.290
I thought we were in this together!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:58.080
Not a chance. Our path splits here.

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:00.750
Are you serious right now?

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.130
I'm against it.

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.290
I don't want us to separate!

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:13.130
I owe you! It was thanks to you I found my true self!

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:16.830
But... all I ever did was use your power for myself.

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:20.040
I haven't done a single thing to repay you yet!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:24.960
I'm gonna close the gate. Get your ass back home.

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:25.750
But!

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:30.290
Sorry. But I've got friends waiting for me on this side.

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.630
I have my own path to follow.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:36.790
But without you... I'm just going to be empty!

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:41.290
Why can't I come with you?!
What's this "own path" crap all of a sudden?!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:44.250
How friggin' dense can you get?!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.210
Choose!

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:49.000
Power or salvation!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:53.580
You chose power.

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:56.330
And that enabled me to find my own path in life.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:01.630
I was an empty husk until you came
and gave me purpose, Kakeru!

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:07.040
I told you, life has no meaning.
You get to decide your own future!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:10.210
You finally ripped yourself free from the past, man!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:13.080
So quit living for others and start living for yourself!

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:16.210
Show me the future that you're gonna make!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:17.960
Ibara...

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:21.670
Come on, let me be a hero.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.830
I wanna be your hero, Kakeru!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:37.290
You already are a hero... Ibara!

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:39.330
So are you, dude.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.380
Kakeru.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.500
Next time the Shikizakura bloom...

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:07.750
remember me, would ya?

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:16.420
Later... partner.

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.460
I never got the chance to ask him.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.460
Oka!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:33.880
K-Kakeru?!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:37.130
Oka!

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:40.750
Kakeru!

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:46.500
Welcome back.

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:50.580
Glad to be back!

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:00.750
<b>2 Years</b>

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:00.750
<b>Later</b>

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:06.130
Looks like you guys finally get to retire, huh?

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.540
Thanks for everything.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:11.920
Welcome.

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:13.630
I'll take 8 please!

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.170
You gave me way more than I ordered!

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:23.790
I hope that this moment never ends

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:21.880
A special gift for a regular.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:25.170
Dude, you are my four-eyed god!

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:27.790
I hope that it continues for decades to come

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:34.210
Becoming unable to even wear pretty outfits

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:31.670
<b>College</b>

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:31.670
<b>Track & Field</b>

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:31.670
<b>Meet</b>

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:38.580
In a world where only I have passed on

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:37.420
I did it!

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.750
The cider I disliked that day

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:44.960
The cry of the missing cicadas

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:44.000
Pardon me a moment.

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:47.290
Drowning into fate

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:50.330
Not knowing how to struggle

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:49.000
I did it!

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:52.210
<b>Shikizakura</b>

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:52.210
<b>Kindergarten</b>

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:55.210
It's almost as if I'm invisible to everyone

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.080
I don't even feel the urge to resist

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:01.000
Doesn't matter.

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:04.750
After you helped pulled me along

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:02.580
Are you okay?

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:08.630
I saw the beautiful colors of the world

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.830
<b>OKA</b>

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.830
<b>Sure</b>

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.830
<b>Be careful!</b>

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.830
<b>I'm headed out</b>

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.830
<b>Oka, how have you been?</b>

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:08.460
<b>OKA</b>

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:08.460
<b>Sure</b>

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:08.460
<b>Be careful!</b>

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:08.460
<b>I'm headed out</b>

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:08.460
<b>Oka, how have you been?</b>

00:22:08.630 --> 00:22:11.250
In the season of blooming cherry blossoms

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:15.420
Captivated by that innocent smile

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:19.460
There is nothing that can't be changed

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:23.460
And that's true of any sad future too, right?

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Thank you for watching!</b>
